{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 47, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Title: A Memorable Journey Through Japan\n\nLast spring, I had the opportunity to visit Japan, a country known for its rich history, unique culture, and technological advancements. The moment I stepped off the plane, I was greeted by the bustling streets of Tokyo, filled with neon lights, towering skyscrapers, and the constant hum of city life.\n\nOne of my favorite experiences in Tokyo was visiting the Tsukiji Fish Market. I woke up early in the morning to witness the hustle and bustle of the world's largest seafood market. The energy was palpable as I watched the auctioneers shout out prices and the fishmongers skillfully cut and prepare the freshest seafood I've ever seen.\n\nAfterward, I indulged in a sushi breakfast at one of the many sushi restaurants in the area. The taste of the fresh seafood was unforgettable, and it was an experience I'll never forget.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I took a bullet train to Kyoto, Japan's cultural heart. There, I visited stunning temples, shrines, and traditional Japanese gardens. I especially enjoyed visiting the Fushimi Inari Shrine, known for its iconic red torii gates that wind up a mountain trail. I spent hours exploring the shrine and marveling at its beauty.\n\nI also had the opportunity to try traditional Japanese tea ceremony, which was a peaceful and meditative experience. It was fascinating to learn about the intricate rituals and customs associated with the preparation and drinking of tea in Japan.\n\nMy trip to Japan was filled with unforgettable experiences, delicious food, and stunning sights. I can't wait to return and explore more of this beautiful country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Title", "logprob": -0.007975990884006023}, {"token": ":", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.08805465698242188}, {"token": "Mem", "logprob": -1.084561824798584}, {"token": "orable", "logprob": -1.1920928244